"P1597117128" "Oranbegan Ghost"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P715566846" "Marcus Valerius. You have travelled far. Your journey is nearly at an end."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2489718189" "We are the spirits of Oranbega. We called you to this cavern to act as our guardian."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4287455796" "We shall use a powerful spell to bind Mot to this cavern, to keep it sealed."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1884158538" "We shall continue to reinforce the binding of this ward until the end of time. However..."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3075596345" "You must stay within the ward and fight off the undead monsters who shall try to stop us."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P727673263" "Should you choose to do so, you will be greeted with a slow and painful death, but you will save the world from the terror of Mot."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P892451606" "I die!"
